{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44291","headline":"恩命追入留别广陵故人 · 李冶","name":"恩命追入留别广陵故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无才多病分龙锺，不料虚名达九重。\n仰媿弹冠上华发，多慙拂镜理衰容。\n驰心北阙随芳草，极目南山望旧峰。\n桂树不能留野客，沙鸥出浦谩相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李冶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}